Description: USB import: PLS playlists of the drive
 Part of the USB import (patch 0016). The *.pls files in the root of a drive
 and in a folder "playlists" there (any case) become playlists of the drive,
 like the rekordbox playlists and Serato crates (locked, listed first,
 deleted when the drive goes). Paths may be relative to the PLS file,
 absolute on the drive, file:// URLs or Windows paths with a drive letter
 (taken as paths on this drive). Test UsbImportTest.Pls.
Author: DecksmithOS
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-24
